{
  "product": {
    "id": 4561082384472,
    "title": "SUPERTOTS FOOD PACIFIER",
    "body_html": "<p>The <strong>SuperTots Food Pacifier</strong> is a 2-in-1 baby fruit feeder and silicone teether that lets your little one safely enjoy fresh fruits, vegetables, and frozen milk — without the risk of choking. Made from 100% <strong>BPA-free, food-grade silicone</strong>, the soft mesh nipple releases only tiny, digestible pieces while gently massaging sore gums for natural <strong>teething relief</strong>. Ideal for babies 5–6 months and up beginning their solid-food journey, the easy-grip handle helps develop hand-eye coordination, and the detachable nipple makes cleaning effortless. Introduce new tastes, soothe teething pain, and feed safely — all with one parent-loved tool.</p>",
